- chars: code points of text after removing 
: [...text.replace(/
/g,'')].length
- words: split original text on whitespace (space, 	, 
) and count non-empty segments
- lines: text.split('
').length

Whitespace splitting: use /\s+/ — but \s includes more than space, 	, 
 (like ). The task says 空白字符(空格、	、
